KG42.register("source_edge_archive-951a0b632caf15c0d43499eb",{"id":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R008::E::v141-c-R008-E003","paper":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation","rule_id":"v141-c-R008","rule_ref":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R008","record":{"edge_id":"v141-c-R008-E003","source":"coordination.local_operator","target":"pricing.local","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R008-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e11","v141-b-g07-ev-05"]},"evidence_class":"S","provenance_gate":"direct_C_edge_with_constraint_and_source_excerpt","scientific_acceptance":false,"accepted_constraint_ids":["v141-c-R008-C003"],"held_constraint_ids":[],"semantic_review_status":"supported","source":"KG31-623d45f464e9bce4","target":"KG31-8571e493b8ecf84a","source_occurrence_id":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R008::V::coordination.local_operator","target_occurrence_id":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-c-R008::V::pricing.local","source_unit_id":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-a-M01::coordination.local_operator","target_unit_id":"11-p2p_mechanisms_evaluation::v141-a-M01::pricing.local","omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"pricing","context_text":"Coordinator pricing in the P2P simulation framework and its SDR realization. | P2P framework under the stated passive-retailer assumptions. | SDR internal buying and selling prices at a given time step. | SDR internal pricing within one energy sharing region.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e11","v141-b-g02-e16","v141-b-g07-ev-05"]},"active":true,"source_signature":"eeba9e015f3ead472e317324c06884efaea09f65d84a13014541758458441d02","relation_scope":"original_occurrence_pair_only","internal_to_parent":false,"source_science":{"mechanism_id":"v141-a-M01","source_definition":"Requested quantities represented in the SDR energy-bid profile are submitted to the local coordinator at every iteration. Scope: SDR iterative submission of signed net-energy profiles within an energy sharing region. Condition: The submitted profile contains a nonnegative net-energy bid at the relevant time step. Offered quantities represented in the SDR energy-bid profile are submitted to the local coordinator at every iteration. Scope: SDR iterative submission of signed net-energy profiles within an energy sharing region. Condition: The submitted profile contains a negative net-energy bid at the relevant time step. The coordinator must provide and operate the trading platform and its associated metering mechanisms. Scope: Coordinator infrastructure obligations in the described local P2P framework. The coordinator does not control devices directly and applies unified rules fairly to all participants. Scope: Coordinator intervention under the paper's heuristic convergence techniques. Condition: When the heuristic techniques interfere with participants' control of their devices. Handling physical-network problems such as overvoltage and congestion is outside the coordinator's modeled remit and is deferred to further research. Scope: Limits of the coordinator's modeled remit in the studied P2P framework.","target_definition":"Internal prices are tariff-bounded functions of the zone supply-demand ratio, with distinct buying/selling roles for net power signs. For SDR above one both equal the export tariff; for SDR between zero and one retain the source nonlinear selling-price formula and buying-price cost/balance construction. Do not generalize denominator limits or fee accounting beyond source conditions.","constraints":[{"constraint_id":"v141-c-R008-C003","kind":"mathematical","role":"core","statement":"The coordinator runs the pricing model to generate internal trading prices for issue to participants. Scope: Coordinator pricing in the P2P simulation framework and its SDR realization.","expression":"p^{\\mathrm{internal}} = Pricing_{T}\\!\\left( p^{\\mathrm{external}}, e^{\\mathrm{bid}}, p^{\\mathrm{bid}} \\right)","formalization_origin":"source","template_id":null,"members":["coordination.local_operator","pricing.local"],"variable_refs":[],"parameter_refs":["theta-p-external","theta-e-bid","theta-p-bid"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e11","v141-b-g07-ev-05"]}],"evidence":[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g02-e11","location":{"location_id":"src-d485825b0d-p06-c1r4__v141-a-M01-pricing","page":6,"printed_page":null,"section":"3.2.3","anchor_text":"Nagent trades with the retailer, including the prices at which the co- asordinator buys and sells th","equation_id":"6","figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-06.png","occurrence_role":"formula"},"source_text":"Taking the information in the environment as input, the coordinator agent runs the pricing model to generate the internal trading price to be issued to the prosumer agents. The pricing model is described as:\np^{\\mathrm{internal}} = Pricing (p^{\\mathrm{external}} ,e^{\\mathrm{bid}} ,p^{\\mathrm{bid}} )\n            T                                                       (6)\nwhere Pricing is the abstract function for generating the internal price."},{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g07-ev-05","location":{"location_id":"src-d485825b0d-p26-c2r3__v141-a-M01-pricing","page":26,"printed_page":"1018","section":"A.2.1","anchor_text":"(A22) (A23) il price between the coordinator and the retailer as illustrated in Fig. 2; SDR haring r","equation_id":"A19-A23","figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-26.png","occurrence_role":"formula"},"source_text":"With the energy bids from all the prosumers, the coordinator calculates the internal selling price by\n\np_t^{sell} = \\begin{cases} \\frac{r_t^{export} \\cdot r_t^{retail}}{(r_t^{retail} - r_t^{export}) \\cdot SDR_t + r_t^{export}}, & 0 \\le SDR_t \\le 1 \\\\ r_t^{export}, & SDR_t > 1 \\end{cases}  (A19)\n\nand the internal buying price by\n\np_t^{buy} = \\begin{cases} p_t^{sell} \\cdot SDR_t + r_t^{retail}(1 - SDR_t), & 0 \\le SDR_t \\le 1 \\\\ r_t^{export}, & SDR_t > 1 \\end{cases}  (A20)\n\nin which\n\nSDR_t = \\frac{\\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}^-} |e_{n,t}^{bid}|}{\\sum_{n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}^+} e_{n,t}^{bid}}  (A21)\n\nwhere\n\n\\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}^- = \\{ n \\mid e_{n,t}^{bid} \u003c 0, n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A} \\}  (A22)\n\nand\n\n\\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A}^+ = \\{ n \\mid e_{n,t}^{bid} \\ge 0, n \\in \\mathcal{P}\\mathcal{A} \\}.  (A23)\n\nIn Formulas (A19)-(A23), r_t^{export} and r_t^{retail} are the export and retail price between the coordinator and the retailer as illustrated in Fig. 2; SDR represents the supply and demand ratio of the whole P2P energy sharing region. Formulas (A19)-(A23) establish the pricing model in the coordinator agent under the SDR mechanism."}],"omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"pricing","context_text":"Coordinator pricing in the P2P simulation framework and its SDR realization. | P2P framework under the stated passive-retailer assumptions. | SDR internal buying and selling prices at a given time step. | SDR internal pricing within one energy sharing region.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e11","v141-b-g02-e16","v141-b-g07-ev-05"]},"source_record":{"edge_id":"v141-c-R008-E003","source":"coordination.local_operator","target":"pricing.local","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R008-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e11","v141-b-g07-ev-05"]},"paper_scope_note":"SDR, MMR, and BS are kept separate; the A18 net quantity differs from the A24 independent component; optional step-size control and the divergent loop in the example are not treated as general convergence or necessary dependencies."}});
